{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-09_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-09","title":"解开铃铛","storyCode":"6-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"7dfd0802b820abe2d2f88505a1c19490705f5991c885b3c212b6957a8ae4be7e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"击退那些穿黑雨披的了！你们，趁这个机会，赶紧走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别谢，有余力的话，最好能和我们一起战斗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到他从四层楼上荡下来，从我头顶上划过去那招吗？要不是我用背包里大姊的源石冻住了他的武器，我已经没了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"真厉害啊，感觉和乌萨斯的防毒面具军刀人一个意思了，不，可能更强！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"差点就没命，怎么还这么兴奋？你说的面具军刀可是乌萨斯皇帝内卫！我们那次也只是碰巧遇上五个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你数得清有几个雨披吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这说明我们比以前更厉害了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是开玩笑的时候，他们的战斗技巧和那身装备，肯定要一个城邦......甚至几个城邦的工业支持才能够成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"没其他小队的帮助，我们根本没可能击退他们，别说让他们减员了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我就......就觉得自己还挺努力的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在的事态明显超出我们的掌控范围了......我们也没法撑太长时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"安静！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"报到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊。这几位是......浮士德的队员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......我记得你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星。我们收到了你的通讯，就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特怎么在你们这？他怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特他似乎......精神受到了一点创伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"他？会精神受创？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，浮士德呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德他为了让我们和其他小队顺利撤退，留在了贫民区之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那种情况下，很难生还。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德是个好战士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星，如果可以，我们想和雪怪一起战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。我们必须让剩下的同胞都顺利逃生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去狙击位待命，之后的战斗，我们一定需要你们的援助。我们不知道敌人会在什么时候再发动进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"收到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"通报，把我们的位置传给各个小队！让他们迅速从这里撤退，我们会保证行进路线的安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"继续去疏散人群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和乌萨斯士兵一样，完全不顾及周围的地形和人群啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得不一样，乌萨斯可是敢在上城区里调用舰炮的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道他们很冷酷，但居然还有这种事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真遇见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这些穿雨衣的确实不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"平民在他们眼里不是障碍，而是同样的目标，因为没法分辨谁是感染者谁不是，他们也不知道我们是不是装扮成了平民的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那乌萨斯是不管不顾，这些人则是一个都不放过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"逃难的人很多，已经快维持不住秩序了！霜星还真是会给人出难题啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊是绝对不会见死不救的，这不分整合运动不整合运动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是打算来龙门加入作战的，怎么一来就净救人了，够奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"还作战呢，已经彻底玩完了，没你们来支援，我们就全死这里了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"很严重啊。真就全指望我们了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别用这种很了不起的口气说话......以前我还觉得你们很可怕，现在，完了，像个街头喜剧演员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你对我们有误解，我们只是没怎么说过话，可怕应该说不上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"就一点，别说指望不指望，我们不是在和你们一起在这防守的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"说得对！兄弟，让我们守住这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我们在这里发现了被困在室内的本地人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"一对母女。我们打算把这里布置成火力点，但不知道怎么和她们沟通......她们似乎被我吓到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（当地语言）！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（当地语言）......（当地语言）......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......她是你的孩子，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇......哇......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"真是健康的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，别怕，别怕。不哭，你妈妈在你身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"有妈妈在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜，哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，哎......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"儿童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这小孩居然笑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"快带她走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......（当地语言）？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们几个，咳，护送她走。去安全的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她们母女是非感染者，我们还有很多同胞没撤出，没多少时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是，都这时候了，还分什么我啊你的。明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，呃，女士，嗯......zhebianzou？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门市民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"nimen，nimen......hao。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星姊，记得等我们回来。可别再强撑着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"别小看大姊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走！他们来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"还有穿其他制服的部队在部署进攻......可能那些才是龙门近卫局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳，呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"已经把区域温度降到最低了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"穿制服的不是我们的对手，但还是得小心那些雨披！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊呢？现在的火力太小了，炮火压制，搞大点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他说他知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我感觉大姊的身体快到极限了，不能再继续降温了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不能破坏现在的路面结构吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，破坏了道路，整合运动和本地人就没有别的通道抵达这个出口了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"确定这是唯一出口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是......所有的其它出口全都被毁了。只有我们破开的这个出口还能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们还剩下多少时间？不，霜星姊还剩下多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么都到这个时候了，还要这么折磨她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这批已经差不多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找大姊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，这批感染者已经全部撤出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"战况......呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我们完全压制住了近卫局。地形很适合我们，近卫局没办法运用他们的数量优势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么好隐瞒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"穿雨披的龙门部队丝毫不在乎地形和居民。他们......他们是要彻底摧毁这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在荡平贫民窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之前看到那些非感染龙门人的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕也是他们做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊，停止施术吧！这一批我们能帮你挡住，至少休息一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......温度在突破下限！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了......成功了！钢骨结构现在已经十分脆弱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"把他们的落脚点砸了，逼他们撤退！快！射击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他们被迫后退了，继续射击！把他们逼回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，动作快些！快，趁现在，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知，知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是大姊，她真的做到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃，你怎么了？表情怎么这么沉重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......大姊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"杨格，过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杨格","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杨格","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你必须信。大姊她没剩多少时间了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
